      "description": "Security Brain Download .SVG Download .PNG Download Brand Kit .ZIP Product Security Brain Lumina Signals Integrations Research Research & Insights Open Security Resources Docs Trust Center Blog Company About us Careers Newsroom Partner with us Security & Trust Contact us Log in Contact us One brain for autonomous security reasoning Sola unites fragmented tools, scattered knowledge, and business context into one living understanding – grounding every security decision and action, by people or by agents, in evidence. Contextual blindspots abound Security teams are paralyzed by a massive context gap. With the average team managing upwards of 45 security tools, they’re drowning in a flood of fragmented tech alerts, while the critical internal context like policies, playbooks, and audits sits trapped in static documents or emails. Without a central reasoning engine to bridge this divide, analysts waste hours manually chasing context, leaving the organization exposed to unvalidated risk. Sitting directly between your raw data and your operations, the Security Brain acts as a central reasoning engine. It instantly matches live alerts with your internal policies and knowledge, turning manual data-stitching into automated triage. Deterministic state mapping Sola maintains a library of expert-written queries that guide the AI on complex, multi-step, multi-vendor patterns. Known-hard problems get known-good logic applied to them. Neutrality by design Every query Sola generates passes static, dynamic, and schema validation before execution. Queries that fail any stage don't run. 2+ years of intelligence curation AWS calls it an \"IAM Role.\" Azure calls it a \"Principal.\" Sola's graph abstracts all vendor semantics into a unified model, so one query returns one coherent finding across your entire stack. The graph powering the brain The Architectural Edge: By continuously precomputing the entire estate’s relationships, blast radius, ownership, and business context, Sola delivers context at the speed of thought. The mathematics of efficiency Context is the bottleneck. Our published research proves that the bottleneck in autonomous security isn’t model intelligence. It’s context quality. When you power frontier models with Sola’s engineered context layer instead of raw telemetry, the shift in performance is immediate: 34% Lift in answer correctness: Eliminating hallucinations by replacing model guesswork with deterministic ground truth. ~70% Fewer queries required: Dramatically reducing reasoning loops, which slashes latency and model token costs. Your company security brain can be up and running in hours. For teams already running a mature, agentic SecOps stack. Talk to us Site footer GDPR ISO 27001:2022 SOC 2 Product Security Brain Lumina Signals Integrations Research Research & Insights Open Security Resources Blog Docs Trust Center Company About us Careers Newsroom Partner with us Security & Trust Accessibility Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Your Privacy Choices © 2026 Sola Security, Inc. Accessibility Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Your Privacy Choices Get a personalized demo Full name* Business email* Country* Please Select Aland Islands Albania Algeria Andorra Angola Anguilla Antigua and Barbuda Argentina Armenia Aruba Australia Austria Azerbaijan Bahamas Bahrain Bangladesh Barbados Belgium Belize Benin Bermuda Bhutan Bolivia Bonaire, Sint Eustatius and Saba Bosnia and Herzegovina Botswana Brazil Brunei Darussalam Bulgaria Burkina Faso Burundi Cambodia Cameroon Canada Cape Verde Cayman Islands Central African Republic Chad Chile China Colombia Comoros Congo Congo, the Democratic Republic of the Cook Islands Costa Rica Cote d'Ivoire Croatia Curaçao Cyprus Czech Republic Denmark Djibouti Dominica Dominican Republic Ecuador Egypt El Salvador Equatorial Guinea Eritrea Estonia Ethiopia Falkland Islands (Malvinas) Faroe Islands Fiji Finland France French Guiana French Polynesia Gabon Gambia Georgia Germany Ghana